Error [E0313]: `start` isn't a member of (high: Int, low: Int)
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_by_position.jet:4:6
    |
  4 |     (start, end) :: bounds()
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(high, low) :: …`, or rename them: `{ high: name, low: name } :: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0313
